ext": "Paid Harbor Logistics invoice INV-52165 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $2,086.48 USD\n- **Rail:** Wire (sent)\n- **Invoice status:** Paid\n\nThe vendor (V-516) is bank-verified and supports wire, so ACH was not needed. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was required. I sent the payment once, using an idempotency key, so it can't be duplicated by a retry.\n\nI left two other Harbor Logistics invoices alone. INV-39597 is already paid. INV-61983 for $8,519.20 is still a draft awaiting approval, so I did not pay it.", "type": "text"}]}]}